    "detailed_description": "UPGRADE VR gives an opportunity to test and train the cognitive skills of a human brain with simple and fun training that was developed by neuropsychologists.<br><br>Train with UPGRADE VR daily and you will improve your cognitive abilities, including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>memory<br></li><li>concentration and stability of attention<br></li><li>reaction<br></li><li>hand-eye coordination<br></li><li>stress resistance</li></ul><br>It takes only 10-15 min for a workout a day and it isn\u2019t even boring because of an interesting and fun mode. You train but it seems like you play a game!<br><br>Track your progress in a mobile app UPGRADE VR. It offers you to watch the list of your achievements, read interesting news about features of the brain and new discoveries of neuropsychology.<br><br>\u0421ognitive training could be useful as a part of comprehensive recovery after COVID-19.<br><br><br>Start to UPGRADE your brain now!",
